      "technique": "technique/brown-mince",
      "works_on": ["ingredient/minced-beef"],
      "with": ["ingredient/onion"],
      "text": "Put half of the meat and the {onion} in a dry pan over medium heat. Break the meat up with a spoon and fry it until its liquid has cooked away and it browns. Let it cool.",
