      "text": "In a bowl, work the browned meat with the raw half, the {rice}[cheese: , the {cheese}][parsley: , the {parsley}], the {cumin}, the {black-pepper} and the {salt}, until the mixture is sticky and holds together.",
      "time": null,
      "temperature": null,
      "safety_points": ["raw-meat-or-fish"],
      "makes": []
    },
    {
      "technique": "technique/shape",
      "works_on": ["ingredient/minced-beef"],
      "with": [],
      "text": "With damp hands, shape the mixture into plump ovals the length of a finger and set them on a tray.",
      "time": null,
      "temperature": null,
      "safety_points": [],
      "makes": []
    },
    {
      "technique": "technique/fry-in-an-egg-coat",
      "works_on": ["ingredient/minced-beef"],
      "with": ["ingredient/flour", "ingredient/egg", "ingredient/sunflower-oil"],
      "text": "Heat the {oil} in a wide pan to the depth of a finger. Beat the {egg:plural} in a shallow bowl. Roll each oval in the {flour}, dip it in the {egg:plural} and lay it straight in the hot {oil}. Fry, turning, until golden on every side, then drain on paper. Check one against a trusted guide to doneness.",
      "time": {"from": 6, "to": 8, "unit": "minute"},
      "temperature": null,
      "safety_points": ["raw-meat-or-fish", "doneness"],
